53:  const defs=[
54:   ['Mara Venn',7.4,7.1,'The neighbor who kept your house key.','Irene was supposed to leave with the last train.','Her porch light is on. She does not own a lamp.','gentle'],
55:   ['Jonah Pike',14.7,7.3,'Grocery clerk, though the store is shuttered.','Your father bought the same thing every Thursday.','He keeps counting the cans. He always loses his place at seven.','wary'],
56:   ['Deputy Ellis',7.6,14.7,'The night deputy. His uniform is dry in the rain.','You weren’t on the list when they found the car.','His incident report is missing one name. He knows which.','guarded'],
57:   ['June Bell',15.2,14.7,'A woman kneeling in the church aisle.','The bell rings from underwater now.','She remembers a funeral with no body and a eulogy in your voice.','sad'],
58:   ['Nurse Ada',30.5,7.2,'A nurse with a visitor badge dated 1998.','Your father asked us to keep the room ready.','She says your father is the patient. She says you were the one who called.','calm'],
59:   ['Cal Rowan',14.6,23.5,'Diner cook. His coffee has a skin of dust.','There is always a place set for one more.','He says you should eat before you go. He does not look at the empty chair.','warm'],
60:   ['The Drifter',22.4,30.4,'Someone standing where the forest road ends.','I remember the first version of you.','The face is almost familiar. It moves only when you look away.','unknown']
61:  ];
